{"id":"n57648-2-7","stage":3,"title":"반짝반짝 · 念头接连浮现","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57648-2-7-1","ko":"이 작가님, 이 이야기는 어떠세요?","zh":"李作家，您觉得这个故事怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"李（姓氏）","explanation":"이：韩国姓氏“李”；“이 작가님”是“李作家”。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:proper-name:이","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"course-authored proper name"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"작가님,","meaning":"作家","explanation":"작가：作家；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"작가","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58277","senseId":"1","lemma":"작가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작가님","audio":"/audio/c19618f25ad5a17e2e98.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기는","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기는","audio":"/audio/dc279e549b59c7224481.mp3"}},{"text":"어떠세요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떠세요","audio":"/audio/408a5132a57148c800a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"李（姓氏）；这（指示）","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","definition":"本句第一处是姓氏“李”，第二处是修饰“故事”的指示词“这”。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"07dda968bf6b7241","term":"작가","zh":"作家","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3","entryId":"58277","definition":"原创出诗歌、小说、剧本、画等的人。","pronunciation":["작까"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"说或写给别人的关于某个事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等的话或文章。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b76e2404134d8ce8477d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57648-2-7-2","ko":"좋네요. 재미있는 소설의 소재가 반짝반짝 떠올라요.","zh":"不错，有趣的小说素材不断在脑海里闪现。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋네요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋네요","audio":"/audio/e36ecc80346ba52c878b.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있는","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있는","audio":"/audio/f963495a3d81a4c95b50.mp3"}},{"text":"소설의","meaning":"小说","explanation":"소설：小说；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"소설","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32185","senseId":"1","lemma":"소설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소설의","audio":"/audio/de3291c65da19d0174e4.mp3"}},{"text":"소재가","meaning":"素材，题材","explanation":"소재：素材，题材；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소재","audio":"/audio/a795d57b8b9f311a7169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49252","senseId":"2","lemma":"소재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소재가","audio":"/audio/91b2789174d14aaed7b7.mp3"}},{"text":"반짝반짝","meaning":"接连闪现","explanation":"반짝반짝：这里形容想法或灵感接连在脑海中闪现，并非灯光在闪烁。","readings":[{"term":"반짝반짝","audio":"/audio/51edb81add6042b86e4c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57648","senseId":"3","lemma":"반짝반짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반짝반짝","audio":"/audio/51edb81add6042b86e4c.mp3"}},{"text":"떠올라요.","meaning":"浮现","explanation":"떠오르다：浮现；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떠오르다","audio":"/audio/82013dc8d822f21e9506.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53785","senseId":"2","lemma":"떠오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠올라요","audio":"/audio/3a394d69a6aa9e51d905.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"88c77f43092f9156","term":"소설","zh":"小说","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3","entryId":"32185","definition":"作家虚构出来的、以故事形式写成的文学作品。","pronunciation":["소ː설"]},{"id":"a795d57b8b9f311a","term":"소재","zh":"素材，题材","audio":"/audio/a795d57b8b9f311a7169.mp3","entryId":"49252","definition":"制作艺术作品时的原始材料，指具体或抽象的对象。","pronunciation":["소재"]},{"id":"51edb81add6042b8","term":"반짝반짝","zh":"想法接连浮现","audio":"/audio/51edb81add6042b86e4c.mp3","entryId":"57648","definition":"想法接连浮现","pronunciation":["반짝빤짝"]},{"id":"82013dc8d822f21e","term":"떠오르다","zh":"浮现","audio":"/audio/82013dc8d822f21e9506.mp3","entryId":"53785","definition":"回忆或想起某件事。","pronunciation":["떠오르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b1048a813f96b4588906.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57648","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["李作家，您觉得这个故事怎么样